  "specialRules": "Pretty Much Human: The warband may hire any Hired Sword that is available to human warbands. | Too Big: Halflings cannot use Long Bows, Elf Bows, Handguns, Long Rifles or Blunderbusses, even after an advance that would normally allow them. | Halfling Items: Owning Halfling items, such as the Halfling Cookbook, gives this warband no bonus. | Adventurer List Restrictions: The dagger (first one free), hammer, axe, sword and helmet in the Adventurer list are sold as Pairing Knife, Tenderiser, Meat Cleaver, Machete and Cooking Pot and may only be bought by the Cook. Double-handed weapons and spears are for Heroes and Warriors only. Bows may not be bought by Warriors. Hunting Arrows (35 gc) are for the Elder and Scouts only."
